WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.942
Unit seventeen. Household Chores!

2
00:00:04.956 --> 00:00:13.082
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Elementary level!

3
00:00:13.132 --> 00:00:17.453
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.503 --> 00:00:21.678
Today we learn: Household Chores. Let's go!

5
00:00:22.565 --> 00:00:26.149
Chore. Say it with me. Chore!

6
00:00:29.667 --> 00:00:33.117
Sweep. Say it with me. Sweep!

7
00:00:36.646 --> 00:00:40.313
Vacuum. Say it with me. Vacuum!

8
00:00:43.753 --> 00:00:47.486
Laundry. Say it with me. Laundry!

9
00:00:50.987 --> 00:00:54.770
Dishes. Say it with me. Dishes!

10
00:00:58.292 --> 00:01:02.209
Tidy up. Say it with me. Tidy up!

11
00:01:05.734 --> 00:01:09.917
Share tasks. Say it with me. Share tasks!

12
00:01:13.377 --> 00:01:18.294
Responsibility. Say it with me. Responsibility!

13
00:01:21.808 --> 00:01:30.551
Grammar time! Present simple for routines. Listen. I sweep the floor every morning.

14
00:01:30.601 --> 00:01:35.457
Your turn. Say it with me. I sweep the floor every morning.

15
00:01:40.509 --> 00:01:52.276
Everyone in my family shares household chores. I sweep the floor and help with the laundry. My brother washes the dishes, and we tidy up together — it's a family responsibility.

16
00:01:52.326 --> 00:01:53.764
I like this story!

17
00:01:54.809 --> 00:02:00.127
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:00.177 --> 00:02:01.327
Vacuum!

19
00:02:02.129 --> 00:02:07.469
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:07.519 --> 00:02:08.852
Share tasks!

21
00:02:10.086 --> 00:02:17.786
Think and answer. What chore do you do most often at home?

22
00:02:17.836 --> 00:02:18.986
Great answer!

23
00:02:20.055 --> 00:02:22.284
This unit's value is Teamwork.

24
00:02:22.334 --> 00:02:24.493
I can show teamwork every day!

25
00:02:25.505 --> 00:02:30.071
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:30.121 --> 00:02:31.745
Goodbye, everyone!

